{
  "about": "Prop menu groups (players asked for pages in the long prop list): a row whose props come from several groups first lists the groups (VANILLA first, then each prop's \"category\", else its mod's name, cut to the button width), and a group opens only its props. Test mod harness_props: BEAR and BUNNY in category Plushies / plushies (one group), CRATE without one (its mod's name). A row with one group only opens the prop list directly. Rows are opened with the passage's real edit-menu buttons; picking BEAR in its group places BEAR. The group list has a back arrow (9081) to the groups. A group shows the new dot while one of its props has not been seen: DOLL (locked) is unlocked by the unlock_prop action, PLUSHIES gets the dot, and opening the group clears it.",
